# Groups that gate Limbo's sockets (docs/QUARANTINE.md). Membership IS the
# access control: add Heimdall's service user to limbo-heimdall and
# Sarina's to limbo-agent, and nobody else. limbo-users is for people: its
# members may read Limbo's figures through user.sock (the Settings page), and
# change their own guests there when "Ask for my password for Limbo changes"
# is off (docs/SETTINGS_PAGE.md).
g limbo-heimdall - -
g limbo-agent  - -
g limbo-users  - -
